{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45623","headline":"闲居拟齐梁四首 四 · 贯休","name":"闲居拟齐梁四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清气生沧洲，残云落林薮。\n放鹤久不归，不知更归否。\n支策到江湄，江臯木叶飞。\n自怜爲客远，还如鹊遶枝。\n南枝复北枝，玉露沾毛衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}